  "brief": "Diamondback is acquiring Double Eagle's Permian assets in a $5 billion deal, expanding its presence in the Permian Basin.\n\nDiamondback / Double Eagle (Announced): Diamondback and Double Eagle Deal. Diamondback is acquiring Double Eagle's Permian assets in a $5 billion deal [1, 4, 6]. The deal includes the purchase of Double Eagle's subsidiaries for $2.15 billion [2, 3, 5]. Diamondback is set to acquire Double Eagle's assets in a deal that will expand its presence in the Permian Basin [2, 5, 7].\nJohnson & Johnson / Ollin Biosciences, Inc. (Announced): Johnson & Johnson to Acquire Ollin Biosciences. Johnson & Johnson is acquiring Ollin Biosciences, Inc. for $3.3 billion [8, 9, 10]. Johnson & Johnson agreed to buy eye disease biotech Ollin for $2.2 billion upfront [9]. Johnson & Johnson will acquire Ollin Biosciences and a late-stage bispecific antibody [10]. Johnson & Johnson is acquiring Ollin Biosciences as part of a larger M&A roundup [11].\nMedtronic / Contego Medical (Announced): Medtronic to Acquire Contego Medical. Medtronic plans to acquire Contego Medical for its vascular portfolio [12, 13, 14]. The deal is worth $380 million [12, 13, 14]. The acquisition is expected to expand access to next-generation carotid therapies [14].\nSamsung / Modine Manufacturing (Rumored): Samsung to Acquire Modine Manufacturing. Samsung is in talks to acquire Modine Manufacturing [15, 17]. The deal has not been officially announced [16]. The acquisition would be a significant move for Samsung [16].\nUniCredit / Commerzbank (Pending approval): UniCredit and Commerzbank Deal. UniCredit has won EU approval for its €45 billion bid to acquire Commerzbank [18, 19, 20]. The deal is now pending approval from Commerzbank's shareholders [22, 23]. The next step will be for UniCredit to get approval from Commerzbank's shareholders [22, 23].\nEli Lilly and Company / Calytrix Bio, Inc. (Announced): Eli Lilly to Acquire Calytrix Bio. Eli Lilly and Company is acquiring Calytrix Bio, Inc. for $1.5 billion [24, 25]. The deal was announced on November 16 [24, 25, 11]. No further information is available [24, 25].\nAlpha Bank S.A. / Altius Insurance Ltd (Completed): Alpha Bank Acquires Altius Insurance. Alpha Bank S.A. has completed the acquisition of Altius Insurance Ltd [26, 27]. The deal is now completed and no further updates are expected [26, 27].\nSwarmer / Vataga Drone Technology (Completed): Swarmer Acquires Vataga Drone Technology. Swarmer has acquired Vataga Drone Technology [28, 29, 30]. The deal is completed [28, 29, 30]. The acquisition adds 15 hardware specialists [28]. The deal includes FPV and interceptor hardware [30].\n\nAlso worth knowing:\n- Valor Energy Inc. Closes Acquisition of 18MW Computing Center in Youngstown, Ohio, Accelerating AI Data Center Expansion [31].\n- Private Equity and Private Credit Firms Manage Trillions, and $90,000 Across These 3 Pays $3,389 a Year in Dividends [32].\n- FDA Approves Three New Therapies | PharmExec [33].",
